Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.06,0:00:24.19,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,But, humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.19,0:00:30.51,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,My myaster loves you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.94,0:00:43.77,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,So if you fall in love with my myaster, I think that might bottle me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.21,0:00:53.43,Default,A,0,0,0,,Quit joking. Even I'm not gonna fall for that one.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.14,0:00:58.89,Default,A,0,0,0,,Plus, it's just terrible.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.89,0:01:02.18,Default,A,0,0,0,,In this world, there are good lies and bad lies, and{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.18,0:01:08.30,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,You really are stupid, humyan. Do you think I'm clever enough to lie to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.09,0:01:15.08,Default,A,0,0,0,,But, cat. If that's not a lie...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.08,0:01:16.67,Default,A,0,0,0,,Aren't you just mistaken?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.67,0:01:18.59,Default,A,0,0,0,,There's no way she could be in love with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.59,0:01:24.58,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Why do you think that? I wouldn't understand my myaster.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.58,0:01:27.90,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,She's the only my myaster I have.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.90,0:01:29.56,Default,A,0,0,0,,But{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.56,0:01:36.57,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,But even though she loves you, you're going out with someone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.57,0:01:41.03,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,And showing it off in front of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.99,0:01:45.49,Default,A,0,0,0,,But Hanekawa isn't acting like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.49,0:01:51.51,Default,A,0,0,0,,If anything, she wants me to be with Senjougahara! She's even given me advice{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.51,0:01:55.21,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,That's exactly what has her so stressed, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.14,0:02:04.02,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Do you think a girl like my myaster could work up the guts to ask {\i1}you{\i0} out?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.78,0:02:10.65,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,She couldn't even let slip a single hint of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.74,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,I don't know everything, I{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.77,0:02:29.77,Default,A,0,0,0,,Wow, Hanekawa was{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.65,0:04:14.67,Default,A,0,0,0,,How long?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.31,Default,A,0,0,0,,How long has Hanekawa loved me?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.61,0:04:23.99,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Since spring break.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.99,0:04:29.80,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,I guess my myaster thought the humyan/vyampire relationship thing was the purrfect thing
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.80,0:04:35.95,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,to break her free from the life she was sick of. {hi jaka if you decide you're unlazy enough to change a couple lines and rerelease my script again, this is where you make a twilight joke you can samefag-troll yourself about.}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.26,Default,A,0,0,0,,That's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.83,0:04:44.92,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,But she never would have expected a rival to appear, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.92,0:04:50.10,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the girl you're going out with moved in lightning-fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.30,0:05:09.39,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,I never lie.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.13,0:05:11.38,Default,A,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.97,0:05:16.91,Default,A,0,0,0,,If this is true, you've told nothing but lies, Hanekawa Tsubasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.98,0:05:22.23,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,A girl raised in a cold, unloving family.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.23,0:05:24.56,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,During her spring break,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.56,0:05:29.16,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,she has a shocking encounter with a supernyatural entity who happens to be a classmate.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.16,0:05:34.33,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,It feels like fate. Her heart begins to stir.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.33,0:05:40.27,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Then, later, he saves her life{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}she's convinced that it's love.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.27,0:05:43.40,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.40,0:05:49.77,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Whether she's right or wrong, she feels like she's had something purrecious snatched away from her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.65,0:05:56.06,Default,A,0,0,0,,Wait, cat. There's something not quite right there.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.06,0:06:02.67,Default,A,0,0,0,,Even if I'm the source of her stress like you're saying, that wouldn't be enough to release you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.70,Default,A,0,0,0,,There must be something else big that's stressing her out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.70,0:06:08.34,Default,Tu,0,0,0,,Wrong. It's all you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.34,0:06:14.53,Default,A,0,0,0,,But aren't you the embodiment of all the stress Hanekawa built up from her home life?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.53,0:06:18.39,Default,A,0,0,0,,Just a couple months of love shouldn't{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.39,0:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Just"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.39,0:06:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And just what makes you think a few months of lovesickness
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.94,0:06:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,can't be worse than over a decade of family problems, meow?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.99,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What, haven't you ever really fallen for anyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.71,0:06:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just dating that girl to shut her up?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.08,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well dump her and get with my myaster, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.67,0:06:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.55,0:07:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Why not? Don't you need to reward my myaster for everything she's done for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.69,0:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did that, Hanekawa would just be taking advantage of my debt to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.95,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to let her do that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.07,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it. That's just a convenient excuse.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.99,0:07:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't deny my feelings for Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.70,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd go for Hanekawa-san between the two of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.36,0:07:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with how she acts sometimes, I still love Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.69,0:07:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the first woman I've ever really loved.{this leaves entirely too much room for memexarararagi, which is completely intentional.}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.34,0:08:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.95,0:08:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.70,0:08:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter the circumstances, it's Hanekawa's own weakness that brought you forth.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.93,0:08:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What you told me is something Hanekawa should have told me herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just forcing you to do the hard part.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.32,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of people who've lived through the same problems Hanekawa is having
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,without relying on an aberration.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.36,0:08:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Her just relying on you is an insult to each one of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.04,0:08:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve to say that, meow. Oh well, I guess you've earned the right.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.36,0:08:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the guy so kindhearted he'd even sacrifice himself to save a mortally-wounded vyampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.02,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're kind to everyone, that means no humyan is special.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.10,0:09:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that because my myaster was kind to everyone, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.21,0:09:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, there's no changing someone's feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.11,0:09:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned that last time. Learned it quite well, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.32,0:09:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.98,0:09:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Hanekawa feels the same way, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.12,0:09:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I might have been a bit harsh scolding her like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.43,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.10,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Vampires have a special charisma, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.61,0:09:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of it I've been popular with the girls since spring break. Hanekawa told me that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.25,0:09:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa's always so serious. If she's so caught up in her feelings, she {\i1}must{\i0}{\fscx40} {\fscx100} have been a victim of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.41,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why did you stop talking?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.76,0:10:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A knockoff vyampire like you can't use his charismya at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.64,0:10:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.66,0:10:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of charismya isn't a love potion like that, anyway. {fuck the word hore. especially when used in this show.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.92,0:10:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx90}It's the power to completely remove their will, purroducing nothing more than your very own marionette.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marionette? {Teacher's pet!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just infatuate them?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.78,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just think, humyan. Are any of the girls you know what you'd call "completely obedient"?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.58,0:10:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who'll do anything you say, with no questions asked?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.20,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a one.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.45,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.99,0:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just teasing.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.79,0:10:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.80,0:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no changing someone's feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.52,0:11:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not like my myaster at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.08,0:11:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I gave it away by being too dumb to lie, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.70,0:11:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's another hard part she forced you to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.07,0:11:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should be proud that Hanekawa loves me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.86,0:11:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we need to find Shinobu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.01,0:11:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, no one I asked to help has gotten back to me yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.97,0:11:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I should probably tell Sengoku to call it off soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, humyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.60,0:11:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one other way.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.48,0:12:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to confine me again without relying on a vyampire.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.24,0:12:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you walk on over to that streetlight?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.45,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.76,0:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A little bit further, meow. You're right under it, so you don't have enough of a shadow there.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.48,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.81,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat, you{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.79,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I didn't just come here to make friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.86,0:13:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not pathetic enough yet to want to be friendly with a human.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.52,0:13:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think this will accomplish?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.33,0:13:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I had another plan, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.79,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be here if the source of her stress{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}you{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}is gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.73,0:13:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.12,0:13:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.77,0:13:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When you attacked Hanekawa's parents during Golden Week...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.22,0:13:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just doing that won't solve anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.16,0:13:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't go away! You started attacking passersby!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.99,0:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Human stress isn't that simple!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.74,0:14:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed that time. I didn't kill her parents, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.00,0:14:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned. I won't make the same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.36,0:14:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will certainly kill you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.32,0:14:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.56,0:14:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Hanekawa's inner thoughts.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa's words.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.28,0:14:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe Hanekawa my life. I'd do anything for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.13,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy. You get to ride my myaster's naughty body straight to Heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.27,0:14:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying for Hanekawa's sake.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.69,0:14:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.20,0:14:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If Hanekawa kills me, Senjougahara will kill her for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.45,0:15:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can't die!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.95,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the absolute worst way to handle it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.59,0:15:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.67,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleading for your life?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.32,0:15:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. If you promise you'll be my myaster's lover, I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure did.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.31,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.19,0:15:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.45,0:15:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you could try calling for someone to help?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.49,0:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've helped plenty of people, maybe one of them will return the favor.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.71,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.92,0:16:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's going to save me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.53,0:16:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.93,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,People just accept help selfishly, for their own sake.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.69,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really think that, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.95,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just something you say.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not how you feel, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.49,0:16:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The question's how you really feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.38,0:16:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe people do just accept help selfishly for their own sake{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.06,0:16:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but what does that have to do with the reasons their helper has?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.92,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people do you think want to help you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.55,0:16:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you rejecting every one of them?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.43,0:16:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be sad, wouldn't they.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa and Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru and Sengoku, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.81,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Save... me...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.45,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.98,0:17:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.16,0:17:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough of a shadow there.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.01,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.77,0:18:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go any further, you'll kill Hanekawa too. I don't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.65,0:18:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.40,0:19:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say lonely things like, "I care more about my debt to you than our friendship."
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.66,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Be nice, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.38,0:19:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, onii-chan, it's morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.05,0:19:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.51,0:19:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come {\i1}on{\i0}{\fscx40} {\fscx100}!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.60,0:19:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come {\i1}on{\i0}{\fscx40} {\fscx100}!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.54,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, Kanbaru, who had come to check up on us, helped me and Hanekawa home.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.66,0:19:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And that day, before school, I went to the ruined cram school.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.68,0:19:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring Shinobu, still hidden in my shadow, back to Oshino.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.47,0:20:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.35,0:20:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to stop for something.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.31,0:20:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.85,0:20:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.71,0:20:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.28,0:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.16,0:20:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet how much Hanekawa remembers.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.67,0:20:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask her someday, but not now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.42,0:20:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa needs time to mend her heart, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.31,0:20:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.85,0:20:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.60,0:21:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You get to plan our next date.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.83,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you bring me somewhere weird, I'll flay you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.70,0:21:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with that.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.95,0:21:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll show you my treasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.71,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday even crabs need to start on a journey.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.47,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had Kanbaru wait for us, and after school she,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.78,0:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, Hanekawa, and I went back to the ruined cram school.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.63,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I'll leave this city.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.74,0:21:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came here yesterday...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.87,0:22:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino was outside getting ready to move on.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.75,0:22:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't just disappear without telling you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.90,0:22:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an adult, so I at least know to do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I realize?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.02,0:22:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That line itself just had to have been a farewell.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.61,0:22:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the kind of person who never says goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.71,0:22:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That awkward man who hates farewells more than anything...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows just how deeply he cared about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.21,0:22:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When I went searching for for Shinobu, he let the meddlecat free on purpose, and left this place behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.51,0:22:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he believed I could handle Shinobu and Hanekawa myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, he really was.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.42,0:23:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.78,0:23:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.40,0:23:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure was.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.41,0:23:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice guy.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.42,0:23:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I may meet more aberrations in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.75,0:23:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.26,0:23:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.75,0:23:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's dark places in this world, and things that live in them.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.51,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even within my own shadow.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.02,0:23:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The culture festival finally starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.02,0:23:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our class project is{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.00,0:23:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a haunted house.
